nsors and time-of-day scheduling.\", \"sku\": \"BL-SKY250\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-sky250\", \"category\": \"ceiling-led\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-sky250.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 1500, \"highPrice\": 10000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-sky250\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"2.5mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1,500 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"384 x 192 per panel\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 2.5mm, which means there is a 2.5mm space between each pixel. This fine pitch delivers ultra-high resolution visuals that are ideal for close viewing distances, especially important for detailed overhead ceiling displays.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm be integrated with building automation systems?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, this LED ceiling display supports smart integration protocols such as BACnet and KNX, enabling seamless control and synchronization with IoT devices and smart building management systems.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the brightness level of this ceiling LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm offers a brightness of 1,500 nits, ensuring vivid visuals and excellent legibility even in ambient light conditions common in luxury interiors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How heavy is the SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm display per square meter?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It weighs 10 kilograms per square meter, making it lightweight enough for easy ceiling installation without requiring extensive structural reinforcement.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of warranty and lifespan can I expect?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The product has a lifespan of 100,000 hours, and Brightluxx typically offers a comprehensive warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance, ensuring long-term reliability for your investment.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm compare to other ceiling LED options?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Compared to larger pixel pitch ceiling LEDs, the 2.5mm pitch delivers much higher resolution, ideal for premium environments. It also features smart IoT triggers and advanced brightness unlike many alternatives, providing superior visual impact.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of content can be displayed on this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It supports dynamic digital art and digital sky content, creating immersive ceiling experiences. Its IoT capabilities enable interactive content triggered by occupancy and time-of-day scheduling for tailored ambience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is installation complex for ceiling mounting?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is designed for overhead mounting with modular 480 x 480mm panels. Its lightweight design and standardized panel size facilitate quicker, safer installation by professional integrators.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-sky250\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm</h1><p>Upgrade with SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm LED display in Dubai. Perfect clarity and brightness. Contact Brightluxx UAE for premium LED solutions today!</p><p><strong>High-resolution ceiling. Architectural masterpiece.</strong></p><p>Fine-pitch ceiling LED for premium architectural applications. 2.5mm pitch delivers stunning overhead visuals with IoT integration for smart building systems. Supports interactive content triggered by occupancy sensors and time-of-day scheduling.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm and why is it important?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 2.5mm, which means there is a 2.5mm space between each pixel. This fine pitch delivers ultra-high resolution visuals that are ideal for close viewing distances, especially important for detailed overhead ceiling displays.</p><h3>Can the SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm be integrated with building automation systems?</h3><p>Yes, this LED ceiling display supports smart integration protocols such as BACnet and KNX, enabling seamless control and synchronization with IoT devices and smart building management systems.</p><h3>What is the brightness level of this ceiling LED display?</h3><p>The SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm offers a brightness of 1,500 nits, ensuring vivid visuals and excellent legibility even in ambient light conditions common in luxury interiors.</p><h3>How heavy is the SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm display per square meter?</h3><p>It weighs 10 kilograms per square meter, making it lightweight enough for easy ceiling installation without requiring extensive structural reinforcement.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"bl-sky250\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"products/bl-sky250\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"script-0\\\",{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\",\\\"async\\\":true,\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"