ral reinforcement.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of warranty and lifespan can I expect?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The product has a lifespan of 100,000 hours, and Brightluxx typically offers a comprehensive warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance, ensuring long-term reliability for your investment.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm compare to other ceiling LED options?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Compared to larger pixel pitch ceiling LEDs, the 2.5mm pitch delivers much higher resolution, ideal for premium environments. It also features smart IoT triggers and advanced brightness unlike many alternatives, providing superior visual impact.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of content can be displayed on this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It supports dynamic digital art and digital sky content, creating immersive ceiling experiences. Its IoT capabilities enable interactive content triggered by occupancy and time-of-day scheduling for tailored ambience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is installation complex for ceiling mounting?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is designed for overhead mounting with modular 480 x 480mm panels. Its lightweight design and standardized panel size facilitate quicker, safer installation by professional integrators.\"}}]}a:X\nf:X\nf:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"0VevTopRFbkV79u5_PhIJ\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$3\"}}],\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$L6\"],\"$L7\"]}],null,\"$L8\"]}],\"isPartia