tluxx UAE for premium LED solutions today!</p><p><strong>High-resolution ceiling. Architectural masterpiece.</strong></p><p>Fine-pitch ceiling LED for premium architectural applications. 2.5mm pitch delivers stunning overhead visuals with IoT integration for smart building systems. Supports interactive content triggered by occupancy sensors and time-of-day scheduling.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm and why is it important?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 2.5mm, which means there is a 2.5mm space between each pixel. This fine pitch delivers ultra-high resolution visuals that are ideal for close viewing distances, especially important for detailed overhead ceiling displays.</p><h3>Can the SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm be integrated with building automation systems?</h3><p>Yes, this LED ceiling display supports smart integration protocols such as BACnet and KNX, enabling seamless control and synchronization with IoT devices and smart building management systems.</p><h3>What is the brightness level of this ceiling LED display?</h3><p>The SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm offers a brightness of 1,500 nits, ensuring vivid visuals and excellent legibility even in ambient light conditions common in luxury interiors.</p><h3>How heavy is the SkyScreen Premium 2.5mm display per square meter?</h3><p>It weighs 10 kilograms per square meter, making it lightweight enough for easy ceiling installation without requiring extensive structural reinforcement.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\